            "summary": "Just a fun sketch playing with geometric shapes to create an interesting&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/49/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01591_.png\" data-size=\"1936x2592\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/49/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01591_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/49/gallery/IMG_20131211_095457.jpg\" data-size=\"1936x2592\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/49/gallery/IMG_20131211_095457-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/49/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01592_.png\" data-size=\"1936x2592\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/49/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01592_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/49/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01593_.png\" data-size=\"1936x2592\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/49/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01593_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/49/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01594_.png\" data-size=\"1936x2592\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/49/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01594_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>Just a fun sketch playing with geometric shapes to create an interesting flower design. For the AI image I felt some fairies tending to the flower would add a little something special.</p>",
