            "summary": "This is a fun design for a t-shirt for our college block&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/47/gallery/fit-party-tshirt-large.jpg\" data-size=\"389x600\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/47/gallery/fit-party-tshirt-large-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"389\" height=\"600\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/47/gallery/ComfyUI_00451_.png\" data-size=\"1224x1688\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/47/gallery/ComfyUI_00451_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1059\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>This is a fun design for a t-shirt for our college block party. So many years later this was fun to think about the good ole days in college and add a little color to this design with AI.</p>",
