        {
            "id": "https://rudytrnka.com/never-forgotten.html",
            "url": "https://rudytrnka.com/never-forgotten.html",
            "title": "Never forgotten",
            "summary": "This was a rough sketch for a concept I had to honor&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00081_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00081_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/20251106_121853-2.jpg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/20251106_121853-2-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00083_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00083_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00090_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00090_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00092_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00092_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00097_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00097_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00103_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00103_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00104_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00104_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>This was a rough sketch for a concept I had to honor the fallen hero's, a beach of dreams unseen by the living world. A place where the hero's watch over the living world. A place that lives in the mind of those who live because hero's give their life to save other's no matter the cost. The buildings live on in spirit preserved by the fallen who live on in our memories. I never had time to draw this concept and it was a perfect candidate to see what AI could do with my rough sketch.</p>",
            "image": "https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/46/Qwen_Edit_2511_00103_.png",
            "author": {
                "name": "Rudy"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "Rough Sketch",
                   "AI Image"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-07-23T22:29:40-04:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-25T16:07:43-04:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://rudytrnka.com/beauty-of-emptiness.html",
            "url": "https://rudytrnka.com/beauty-of-emptiness.html",
            "title": "Beauty of Emptiness",
            "summary": "This fine art painting is my interpretation of the Japanese concept of&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/45/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01669_.png\" data-size=\"1328x1328\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/45/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01669_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/45/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00820_.png\" data-size=\"1024x1024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/45/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00820_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/45/gallery/scan0013-460x240.jpg\" data-size=\"460x240\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/45/gallery/scan0013-460x240-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"460\" height=\"240\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>This fine art painting is my interpretation of the Japanese concept of \"<strong>Ma</strong>\" or \"<strong>Yohaku no bi</strong> \". The concept is basically leaving open space for the mind to roam free. I used the the general structure of a butterfly to convey this concept in a self refection portrait. The butterfly represents me as a layered complex form that is one with nature. The butterfly is actually formless only a hint of its form is seen and the mind makes connections. The void of open space sphere represents the open mind needed for this balance to exist. The AI images where fun to play with placing the artwork in different enviroments.</p>",
            "image": "https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/45/Qwen_Edit_2511_01669_.png",
            "author": {
                "name": "Rudy"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "Fine Art",
                   "AI Image"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-07-23T21:14:06-04:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-23T21:17:29-04:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://rudytrnka.com/visiting-the-5th-dimension.html",
            "url": "https://rudytrnka.com/visiting-the-5th-dimension.html",
            "title": "Visiting the 5th Dimension",
            "summary": "original This is a simple painting of a theory of dimensions appearing&hellip;",
